mark draft

# SHELVED 2026-10-02 (base-v1-0018): a mock, snapshot, coverage and suite sketch with bodiless public tasks whose names
# (`make`, `read`, `replace`, `reset`, `match`) are package-global and shadow the real ones wherever this is built.
# Nothing loads it. Term's test framework is the `test <phrase>` block with `want hold` / `want miss`, run by
# `term test` (deck/call/code/test-preprocess.ts), held across backends by `pnpm term:base-gate`.

form mock
  link dock, mark private

task make
  take returns, need false
  take
    handler
    like task
    need false
  like mock

task replace
  take target, like task
  take mock, like mock

task read
  take mock, like mock
  take
    field
    like text
    fall text <calls>

task reset
  take mock, like mock
